1
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:06,100
Captain. The bank has taken the left
engine.

2
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:07,390
Which one's the left?

3
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:09,020
The one that has stopped.

4
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:13,150
And the navigation lights. And the
heating. And the coffee machine.

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:14,950
They can't take the coffee machine.

6
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:17,030
It was financed separately.

7
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:26,480
Good morning! This is Temi in Recoveries. Your vessel is being recovered. Full
recovery, including the air, at six tonight, lunar time. Please remain seated while–

8
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:28,820
Temi! Hi! I'm about to make a payment–

9
00:00:29,910 --> 00:00:31,110
–we disable your–

10
00:00:31,310 --> 00:00:32,440
A big one. Enormous–

11
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:35,110
Hello! You're speaking to Temi in
Recoveries!

12
00:00:35,310 --> 00:00:36,580
Why does she keep doing that?

13
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:39,770
She is in Lagos. You are arguing with the
past.

14
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:40,910
And I'm winning.

15
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:48,550
A job, posted to us directly. One parcel, sealed,
prepaid. Shackleton crater, by six tonight. The fee is–

16
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:49,700
Is?

17
00:00:49,570 --> 00:00:51,900
Exactly what we owe. To the cent.

18
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:52,900
Take it.

19
00:00:52,910 --> 00:00:54,270
You have not read the–

20
00:00:54,470 --> 00:00:55,920
Take it take it take it take it–

21
00:00:56,260 --> 00:01:00,370
Accepted. I am also filing a report on
you. Once is binding.

22
00:01:06,390 --> 00:01:07,910
Who sends a parcel to a crater?

23
00:01:08,110 --> 00:01:10,950
Someone who knew precisely how much we
owed.

24
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:12,100
Lucky.

25
00:01:12,080 --> 00:01:13,960
Filed under "arithmetic".
